{
  "@context": {
    "schema": "https://schema.org/"
  },
  "@type": "Note",
  "@id": "string",
  "title": "Dashboard Design Methodology",
  "status": "draft",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b-1",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Dashboard Design Methodology"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-2",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Dashboard Design Framework Playbook**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Phase 1: Requirements Gathering**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. **User Role Matrix**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- List all user roles (Admin, Manager, Content Creator, Viewer)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Map permissions: Create/Read/Update/Delete/Export per data type"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-7",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Identify primary goals for each role (Monitoring? Analysis? Action?)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-8",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. **Data Hierarchy Exercise**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-9",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- List all potential metrics/KPIs"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-10",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Categorize using **Moscow Method**:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-11",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Must Have**: Critical real-time data (e.g., system health)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-12",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Should Have**: Daily decision-making metrics"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-13",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Could Have**: Nice-to-have contextual data"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-14",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Won't Have**: Saved for drill-down views"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-15",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. **Interaction Flow Mapping**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-16",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Create user journey maps for key tasks"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-17",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Example:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-18",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-19",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Alert → Diagnose → Compare history → Take action → Log resolution"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-20",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-21",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Phase 2: Layout Architecture**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-22",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. **Grid System Principles**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-23",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Base layout on **12-column responsive grid**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-24",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Use 3 core patterns:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-25",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```html"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-26",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<!-- Pattern 1: Single Column (Stripe-style) -->"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-27",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-8\">"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-28",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<!-- Hero Metric -->"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-29",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<!-- Key Stats Row -->"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-30",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<!-- Primary Content -->"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-31",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "</div>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-32",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<!-- Pattern 2: 3-Column Dashboard -->"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-33",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6\">"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-34",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<!-- Left: Filters/Controls -->"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-35",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<!-- Center: Primary Visualization -->"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-36",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<!-- Right: Secondary Metrics -->"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-37",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "</div>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-38",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<!-- Pattern 3: Monitoring Dashboard -->"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-39",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<div class=\"grid xl:grid-cols-[300px_1fr] gap-6\">"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-40",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<!-- Sidebar: Alerts/Status -->"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-41",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<!-- Main: Grid of system cards -->"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-42",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "</div>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-43",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-44",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. **Visual Hierarchy Rules**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-45",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Apply **5-Second Rule**: Most important info visible without scrolling"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-46",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Size hierarchy:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-47",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-48",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Hero Numbers (32px) → Section Headers (24px) → Card Titles (18px) → Body (14px)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-49",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-50",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Color intensity scale:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-51",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Critical (Red) → Warning (Orange) → Normal (Blue) → Neutral (Gray)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-52",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Phase 3: Component Library**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-53",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. **Standardize Widget Types**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-54",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-55",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "type DashboardWidget = {"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-56",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "id: string"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-57",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "type: 'metric' | 'chart' | 'table' | 'status' | 'action'"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-58",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "size: 'sm' | 'md' | 'lg' // Maps to grid columns"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-59",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "dataSource: string"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-60",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "requiredPermissions: string[]"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-61",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "defaultPosition: { x: number, y: number }"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-62",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-63",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-64",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. **Responsive Behavior Matrix**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-65",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| Breakpoint | Columns | Gutters | Card Padding |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-66",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| --- | --- | --- | --- |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-67",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| Mobile | 1 | 16px | 12px |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-68",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| Tablet | 2 | 24px | 16px |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-69",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| Desktop | 3-4 | 32px | 24px |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-70",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Phase 4: Permission-Based Variations**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-71",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. **View Template System**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-72",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-73",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "interface DashboardView {"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-74",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "viewId: string"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-75",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "requiredRole: string"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-76",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "defaultWidgets: WidgetId[]"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-77",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "allowedCustomizations: ('add' | 'remove' | 'resize')[]"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-78",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-79",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-80",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. **Progressive Disclosure Strategy**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-81",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Layer information density:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-82",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-83",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Basic View → Add Filters → Expand Details → Full Analysis Mode"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-84",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-85",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Phase 5: Customization Framework**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-86",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. **Drag-and-Drop System Requirements**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-87",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-88",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "const dashboardEngine = {"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-89",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "layoutEngine: 'gridstack' | 'react-grid-layout',"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-90",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "persistence: {"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-91",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "autoSave: true,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-92",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "versioning: true"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-93",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "},"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-94",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "constraints: {"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-95",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "maxWidgets: 12,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-96",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "reservedAreas: ['alert-banner']"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-97",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-98",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-99",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-100",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. **State Management Flow**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-101",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-102",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "User Interaction → Layout Update → Validation →"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-103",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Save to User Profile → Broadcast to Sync Service →"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-104",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Update Local State"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-105",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-106",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Implementation Checklist**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-113",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-107",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "[ ]  Audit existing analytics/reporting tools"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-108",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "[ ]  Conduct user interviews with role representatives"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-109",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "[ ]  Create priority matrix for metrics"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-110",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "[ ]  Build component library in Storybook"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-111",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "[ ]  Implement baseline permission system"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-112",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "[ ]  Set up layout persistence layer"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-114",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-115",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Customization Strategy Blueprint**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-116",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. **Preset System**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-117",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Curated layouts for different roles/use cases"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-118",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- \"Reset to Default\" safety net"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-119",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. **Widget Marketplace Concept**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-120",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-121",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "type WidgetDefinition = {"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-122",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "id: string"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-123",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "installable: boolean"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-124",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "dependencies: string[]"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-125",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "compatibility: Role[]"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-126",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-127",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-128",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. **Layout Validation Rules**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-129",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Prevent critical data removal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-130",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Maintain minimum information density"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-131",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Enforce brand consistency"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-132",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
